{"unit_id":"JunguangJiang__dsh-agent-lead#card-zh","repo":"JunguangJiang/dsh-agent-lead","commit":"88b05f51dd424caa454ee6320b5b10c130f3629c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-agent-lead**（DSH 网页客户端插件）：为主 Agent 提供带队模式，让它规划任务、派发给后台 subagent 并跟进验收。插件注册 `/lead` 命令、提示词策略、写工具限制，以及 `assign`、`redirect`、`manage_queue`、`lead_status` 工具，可选择子模型、检查职责范围重叠、管理队列并查看子 Agent 状态。网页输入区显示可点击退出的模式标记。适合希望由主 Agent 统筹多个后台子 Agent 完成改动的场景。需要配置 LLM provider、模型列表及 DSH subagent 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:678-720","index.mjs:1002-1012","index.mjs:1162-1168","ui/lib/client.js:91-104"]}
{"unit_id":"JunguangJiang__dsh-agent-lead#card-en","repo":"JunguangJiang/dsh-agent-lead","commit":"88b05f51dd424caa454ee6320b5b10c130f3629c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-agent-lead** is a DSH plugin for coordinating subagents. `/lead` supports planning, model selection, delegation, redirection, queue management, and status tracking. It helps coordinate coding work across background agents. Requires an LLM provider, model list, and DSH subagent service.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:678-720","index.mjs:1002-1012","index.mjs:1162-1168","ui/lib/client.js:91-104"]}
