{"unit_id":"JunguangJiang__dsh-agent-lead#feature-1","repo":"JunguangJiang/dsh-agent-lead","commit":"88b05f51dd424caa454ee6320b5b10c130f3629c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-agent-lead** 的功能「带队模式」：通过 `/lead` 命令切换主 Agent 的规划和监工提示；可用 `/lead auto` 开启自动派活，或用 `/lead manual` 恢复逐次选择模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:758-810","index.mjs:687-720"]}
{"unit_id":"JunguangJiang__dsh-agent-lead#feature-2","repo":"JunguangJiang/dsh-agent-lead","commit":"88b05f51dd424caa454ee6320b5b10c130f3629c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-agent-lead** 的功能「派发任务」：主 Agent 调用 `assign` 提交自足任务和 scope，插件选择或自动确定模型后启动后台可续 subagent，并记录成功派活的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:1002-1012","index.mjs:1060-1155"]}
{"unit_id":"JunguangJiang__dsh-agent-lead#feature-3","repo":"JunguangJiang/dsh-agent-lead","commit":"88b05f51dd424caa454ee6320b5b10c130f3629c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-agent-lead** 的功能「推翻任务」：主 Agent 用 `redirect` 指定子 Agent 和新任务；插件会校验后代关系、打断运行、按需清空队列，再发送取代旧安排的指令。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:1162-1168","index.mjs:1220-1277"]}
{"unit_id":"JunguangJiang__dsh-agent-lead#feature-4","repo":"JunguangJiang/dsh-agent-lead","commit":"88b05f51dd424caa454ee6320b5b10c130f3629c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-agent-lead** 的功能「查看状态和队列」：主 Agent 可查看子 Agent 状态、派活台账、职责范围及待办消息，并通过 `manage_queue` 列出、清空、删除、替换或插入队列消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:1293-1310","index.mjs:1450-1455","index.mjs:1500-1600"]}
{"unit_id":"JunguangJiang__dsh-agent-lead#caveat-1","repo":"JunguangJiang/dsh-agent-lead","commit":"88b05f51dd424caa454ee6320b5b10c130f3629c","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-agent-lead 使用本机 JSON 文件保存最近的派活模型历史；状态台账保存在内存中，进程重启后会丢失。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:392-438","index.mjs:509-572"]}
